 المتضررة تقع في الجنيد في الجزيرة، وسنغا في سنار، والفاو والحواتة في القضارف، ومشكر في النيل الأبيض. SUBSCRIBER EXCLUSIVE Continue reading this exclusive analysis Original reporting and analysis unavailable elsewhere. Subscribe to AL-MONITOR to read this story and access everything we publish See Offers Read By Related Articles Sudan pushes back after US calls army-led government illegitimate Rosaleen Carroll In Washington, DC, US , reporting on the Middle East Interview Ex-PM says Sudan risks partition amid US ceasefire push Sudan US envoy attends event with Sudanese army chief in Egypt US ceasefire plan for Sudan could lead to Libya-style partition, adviser says Related Newsletters Newsletter: Gulf MBS visits Egypt as Houthi attacks escalate Francesco Schiavi In Bologna , reporting on security, defense, economy, governance Newsletter: Daily Briefing Saudi Arabia accuses Houthis of Medina strike Gabrielle Debinski In New York City , reporting on the Middle East Newsletter: Business & Tech Saudi economic ambitions under strain Jack Dutton In Bristol , reporting on regional business, climate change, AI, tech Newsletter: Business & Tech Saudi oil squeeze deepens Jack Dutton In Bristol , reporting on regional business, climate change, AI, tech The Middle Eastʼs leading independent news source since 2012 Subscribe Now Countries Turkey Saudi Arabia Iran UAE Israel Palestine Egypt Qatar Lebanon Syria Iraq Jordan Oman Bahrain Kuwait Yemen Libya Sudan Tunisia Morocco Algeria Sectors Politics & Security Economy & Business Technology Culture Our Archive Terms of Use Visitor Agreement Privacy Policy FAQs Submissions and Discussions Policy About Us About Journalists Team Careers Add AL-MONITOR on Google Sign up to our Daily Briefing Keep up with AL-MONITOR's top stories with a morning digest from across the region. Sign Up For subscription inquiries, please contact subscription.support@al-monitor.com . For all other inquiries, please use contactus@al-monitor.com . ©2026 AL-MONITOR, LLC. All rights reserved.",
