      "title": "Somalia releases Ebola contact after two negative tests, 21-day quarantine - Hiiraan Online",
      "link": "https://www.hiiraan.com/news4/2026/Oct/206615/somalia_releases_ebola_contact_after_two_negative_tests_21day_quarantine.aspx",
